$MDESC::Type = "CTF Spawn";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> EEPROM Stadium" @
         "\n<f1>Type: <f0> Indoors" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Game Time" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName0> battle each other in a nice game of Tribe Ball. the ruls are simple, grab the flag in the middle of the field and get it into your goal to score. The first team to reach 15 points wins. If you spawn in the waiting room simple switch to another team that is in the game. If the server does not allow team change then contact the admin." @
         "\n\n<f1>Map engineered and designed by:<f0> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)" @
         "\n<f2>You can find this map at www.planetstarsiege.com/extreme or www.resistanceimaging.com/pms";


